    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        -180,
        520
      ],
      "size": [
        1800,
        120
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "HOW THIS PIPELINE WORKS:\n\u2022 Phase 1 (first queue): The Studio chain runs \u2014 Screenwriter transcribes audio, CreativeDirector analyzes lyrics+concept, Director builds Shot List. These nodes cache their results, so they only run their LLM calls ONCE per project.\n\u2022 Phase 2 (each queue, N times): Cinematographer auto-increments to the next scene, feeding its prompt + frame count + audio chunk into the LTX video pipeline.\n\u2022 Phase 3 (last queue): Editor saves the clip. PostMaster detects remaining_scenes=0 and stitches all clips + master audio \u2192 final video."
      ]
    },
